(chrome/browser/resources/settings/appearance_page/aerie_motion_row.*). It is a
settings-dropdown-menu on the pref aerie.motion.reduce (patches/sidebar/0001), with the strings of
patches/sidebar/0002. The element sits between the theme row and the toolbar row. The hunks use
only lines that Chromium has: the imports around home_url_input.js, the toolbarRow div, and the
ts_files list.

